"Modified Version" means a version that copies, modifies, or incorporates copyright-protected portions of the Software.

"OpenAI Organization" means OpenAI and the legal entities through which it conducts its business; any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with those entities; and any successor entity continuing the relevant OpenAI business.

"Control" means the power to direct an entity's management or policies through ownership, voting rights, contract, or equivalent authority.

"Excluded Party" means an entity within the OpenAI Organization, or a person or organization acting on its behalf, at its direction, or as its agent in connection with the relevant activity involving the Software.

Employees, contractors, consultants, research partners, and service providers are Excluded Parties when using the Software in performing work for the OpenAI Organization. Unrelated personal activity is not excluded solely because of a person's employment or association. Merely being an OpenAI customer or using an OpenAI model does not make someone an Excluded Party.

