Eligible users may connect the Software to OpenAI models, APIs, or compatible services for their own otherwise permitted purposes.

Selecting an OpenAI model, paying for inference, or exchanging ordinary inference requests and responses does not, by itself, violate Section 5 or make the user an Excluded Party.

This permission allows eligible users to operate the Software with those services. It does not grant the OpenAI Organization permission to obtain, operate, copy, modify, distribute, or incorporate the Software itself.

Knowingly supplying copies or substantial portions of the Software to an Excluded Party for an excluded purpose is not covered by this permission. The treatment of prompts, responses, and other data under a provider's separate terms is outside the scope of this License.

