For a material violation of another mandatory condition, including false representation of authorship, permissions terminate upon the violation unless the copyright holder expressly agrees otherwise in writing. After termination, the user must cease activities that require permission under this License.

Failure to provide the voluntary public credit requested in Section 3 is not a violation.

Excluded Parties never receive permission under this License. No notice, correction period, or opportunity for reinstatement under this section grants them permission.

